<h1>Tamables: Critters</h1>
<p><strong>Vintage Story: 1.22.x.</strong></p>
<p>the small creatures followed me to the keyboard. i have made room on the pet roster.</p>
<h2>what the fox put together</h2>
<p>PetAI taming and dedicated owned variants for supported non-FotSA animal packs. source mods stay optional. ordinary commands have scoped test coverage; lifecycle and provider coverage is not exhaustive.</p>
<h2>bring these along</h2>
<ul>
<li><strong>game</strong>: 1.22.0 or later</li>
<li><strong>petai</strong>: 5.1.1 or later</li>
</ul>
<h2>the check sheet</h2>
<p>the release record keeps the exact version, package hash and test limits. source compilation is a separate check; it does not establish new gameplay acceptance.</p>
<p><em>mod was made with AI assistance. Pls no hate.</em></p>
